{"3402230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sivers", "steam_appid": 3402230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1787063532\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.webm?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.mp4?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into the unique world of <strong>Sivers</strong> — a dynamic RPG-roguelike where every battle and every decision influence your survival! Face waves of monsters, use the building system and powerful spells to hold your ground as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/5f440effefd43f72b828f59548753d49.poster.avif?t=1787063532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/5f440effefd43f72b828f59548753d49.webm?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/5f440effefd43f72b828f59548753d49.mp4?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Spells:</strong> Combine magical, physical and passive abilities to adapt to different situations and defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies and Bosses:</strong> Foes become increasingly challenging, requiring smart strategies and unexpected ability combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building System:</strong> Create and upgrade various structures to strengthen your defenses and expand your tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Progression:</strong> Develop your hero, unlock new abilities and upgrade your buildings to survive longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Discoveries:</strong> Explore the world, gather resources and unlock hidden opportunities to aid you in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose a challenge level that suits your playstyle — from a relaxed run to a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.poster.avif?t=1787063532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.webm?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.mp4?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sivers</strong> continues to evolve, adding new features, enemies and mechanics. Fight, build, survive — and find your path to victory!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1787063532\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://share