rvive longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Discoveries:</strong> Explore the world, gather resources and unlock hidden opportunities to aid you in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose a challenge level that suits your playstyle — from a relaxed run to a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.poster.avif?t=1787063532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.webm?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/189e84c60f9cbddeef22f7bcb9b5beaf.mp4?t=1787063532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sivers</strong> continues to evolve, adding new features, enemies and mechanics. Fight, build, survive — and find your path to victory!</p>", "short_description": "Sivers is an RPG-roguelike with a unique style, where waves of enemies test your strategy. Use spells and build defenses, develop your hero, and fight bosses and varied foes. Victory on the first try is unlikely — every attempt brings you closer to success!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, Italian, Arabic, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese, Azerbaijani, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Assamese, Afrikaans, Basque, Belarusian, Bangla, Bosnian, Valencian, Welsh, Wolof, Galician, Georgian, Guj